  "created": "2026-09-22T18:40:27.947Z",
  "description": "On-device LLM inference for Circle. 3.6.0: a big model now loads on a small phone — weight-mmap + single-thread with kvcache_mmap OFF. The long-standing MNN generate-time SIGSEGV was kvcache_mmap building a malformed prefix-cache path (a destroyed mutex), never weight-mmap; with it off, Qwen2.5-3B loads and generates on a 3.6 GB device. Adds a per-model mmap gate and mmap-aware device assessment (a slow giant stays compatible, never the silent default). Carries forward RT-08 fallback, PowerBudget / snapshot-restore / prefix-cache, and the <think>→reasoning_content router. mnnbridge native payload unchanged.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "CircleAI.Inference",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-22T18:44:46.58Z",
